{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA encoding on single-profile data, isolating RNA modality as the sole input. Validation accuracy of 0.485 and F1 of 0.464 suggest RNA-only models achieve moderate baseline performance. Uncertainty remains about how this baseline compares to multimodal configurations or more complex encodings, as no alternative designs have been evaluated yet."
}

